Package: ptscore
Title: Statistical Analysis of Proficiency Tests Following ISO 13528
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Buddhika", "Dissanayake", , "buddhi.prime@example.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0009-1349-1746"))
Description:  Tools for analysing proficiency testing and interlaboratory
    comparison data using methods described in ISO 13528, including robust
    estimators of the assigned value and standard deviation, performance
    scores, and homogeneity and stability checks. The package is in early
    development.
